WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.500
This guide shows how scenes and sources work together in Missionnaire Studio.

00:07.500 --> 00:16.500
A scene is a complete layout. Keep simple scenes for the live camera, a shared screen, and a break image. Select the scene you want to prepare.

00:17.500 --> 00:29.500
Choose Add source, then select exactly what the scene needs: a camera, display, image, media file, text, lyrics, or an audio capture.

00:30.500 --> 00:41.500
Sources belong to the selected scene. Use the eye to show or hide one, lock finished items, open Properties to adjust them, and reorder them when they overlap.

00:42.500 --> 00:49.500
Build the scene, check every source in Preview, then send it to Program only when it is ready.
